[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/kindled-ward-light.png" id="3_icon"]

; The autonomous archetype: cast it and it keeps working somewhere you are not.
;
; BaseProjectileCount is how many wards may burn at once, not how many are made per cast - one is
; made per cooldown until the cap is reached. Pure Light, so it is attuned, which is the trade a
; single-tag spell gets for the second tag it does not carry.

; Each ward BURNS WIDER every level (2026-10-27, "kindled ward ... attack area should grow as they
; level up so they become more of a spectacle"): an Area line at every level, a fraction on the
; 34 px strike (Player.FireKindledWard reads AreaSize as 1 + value) - +84% by level 8, 63 px, and
; the mote and its flare are drawn to match (KindledWard._Draw).
